# Extension Architecture

## Overview

| Extension | Version | Entities | Edges | Rules | Enhances |
|-----------|---------|----------|-------|-------|----------|
| @specforge/product | 1.0.0 | 9 | 20 | 50 | — |
| @specforge/software | 1.0.0 | 5 | 15 | 10 | module (+2), milestone (+1) |
| @specforge/governance | 1.0.0 | 3 | 11 | 0 | — |
| @specforge/formal | 1.0.0 | 5 | 10 | 12 | behavior (+7), event (+3), invariant (+1) |

## Dependencies

- @specforge/software → @specforge/product (^1.0, optional)
- @specforge/governance → @specforge/software (^1.0, optional)
- @specforge/governance → @specforge/product (^1.0, optional)
- @specforge/formal → @specforge/software (^1.0)
- @specforge/formal → @specforge/product (^1.0, optional, transitive, unused)

## Enhancements

- @specforge/software enhances @specforge/product/module: +2 fields (ports, ports_defined)
- @specforge/software enhances @specforge/product/milestone: +1 fields (behaviors)
- @specforge/formal enhances @specforge/software/behavior: +7 fields (requires, ensures, maintains, satisfies, sync, abstract, refines)
- @specforge/formal enhances @specforge/software/event: +3 fields (follows_protocol, participates_in, sync)
- @specforge/formal enhances @specforge/software/invariant: +1 fields (expression)

## Cross-Extension Edges

- BehaviorImplementsFeature (@specforge/software.behavior → @specforge/product.feature)
- DecisionProtectsInvariant (@specforge/governance.decision → @specforge/software.invariant)
- ConstraintEnforcedByBehavior (@specforge/governance.constraint → @specforge/software.behavior)
- ConstraintConstrainsBehavior (@specforge/governance.constraint → @specforge/software.behavior)
- ConstraintProtectsInvariant (@specforge/governance.constraint → @specforge/software.invariant)
- FailureModeTargetsInvariant (@specforge/governance.failure_mode → @specforge/software.invariant)
- ConstraintGovernsFeature (@specforge/governance.constraint → @specforge/product.feature)
- DecisionAffectsFeature (@specforge/governance.decision → @specforge/product.feature)
- FailureModeThreatensFeature (@specforge/governance.failure_mode → @specforge/product.feature)
- FailureModeAffectsBehavior (@specforge/governance.failure_mode → @specforge/software.behavior)
- AxiomAssumesInvariant (@specforge/formal.axiom → @specforge/software.invariant)
- PropertyDependsOnInvariant (@specforge/formal.property → @specforge/software.invariant)
- BehaviorRefinesBehavior (@specforge/formal.behavior → @specforge/software.behavior)
- RefinementRefinesAbstract (@specforge/formal.refinement → @specforge/software.behavior)
- RefinementRefinesConcrete (@specforge/formal.refinement → @specforge/software.behavior)

